sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as ActionGate (kaiban-distributed)
  participant V as Carbon validator
  participant C as Governor core
  participant H as Human approver
  participant L as Audit log

  A->>G: evaluate(action, estimated grams CO2e)
  G->>V: check(context)
  V->>C: decide(estimate)
  C-->>V: verdict + pacing ratio
  V-->>G: verdict
  G->>L: append hash-chained record
  G-->>A: most severe verdict wins
  alt allow or degrade
    A->>A: run the action, commit the grams
  else escalate
    A->>H: ask for approval
    H-->>A: approve or refuse
  else block or terminate
    A->>A: do not run the action
  end
